      {
        "finding": "CSP-Fast shows a fast discovery phase followed by a refinement phase. On parity and mod-3, gradient-norm spikes in the refinement phase do not reduce accuracy.",
        "proposed_claim": "Post-convergence gradient-norm volatility tracks seed variance in length generalization.",
